Option Flavour Natural
' Draw.nat - drawing with a turtle, and words of your own made from its words.
' (c) 2026 Cyborg Unicorn Pty Ltd - MIT License
with the turtle

to square using size
  repeat 4 times forward size turn right end
end

to stairs using steps
  repeat steps times forward 2 turn right forward 1 turn left end
end

to spiral using longest
  count side from longest down to 1 forward side turn right end
end

clear
move to 0 0  pen down  spiral 12  pen up

ink "#"
move to 16 0  pen down  stairs 5  pen up

ink "o"
count n from 1 to 3
  move to ( 12 + n * 6 ) ( 8 + n )  pen down  square ( 2 + n )  pen up
end
show
